      "y": 6835,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "c = neutral-axis depth below the compression face; p = fibre coordinate from the centroid,",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_4d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 7106,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "positive towards the compression face; H = section depth in that direction; dt = depth of the",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_4e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 7136,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "extreme bar. The strain plane pivots about A (bar at −εud), B (face at εcu2) or C (εc2 at",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_4f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 7166,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "(1 − εc2/εcu2)·H), whichever governs for the depth c (EC2 Fig. 6.1). Compression positive.",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_4g",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 7293,
      "props": {
