        "h": 32,
        "latex": "N_{R}\\left(c,\\beta\\right)\\coloneq A_{f}\\mathrm{sum}\\left(\\sigma_{f}\\left(c,\\beta\\right)\\right)+A_{b}\\mathrm{sum}\\left(\\sigma_{b}\\left(c,\\beta\\right)\\right)",
