        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "8. SHEAR CHECK (§6.2.3, LINKS)",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 16,
        "color": "#0f172a",
        "align": "left",
        "heading": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_6g",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 11199,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "Truss model (EC2 6.2.3): concrete struts at angle θ, links as ties; VRd,c = 0.",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_6h",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 11229,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "Compression (NEd ≥ 0): a flatter strut (larger cotθ) needs fewer links, but the strut",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_6i",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 11259,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "crushes when VEd &gt; VRd,max = bw·z·ν1·fcd / (cotθ + tanθ). So cotθ is the largest value",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_6j",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 11289,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "with cotθ + tanθ ≤ a = bw·z·ν1·fcd / VEd, capped at 2.5 (a ≥ 2.9 gives 2.5). If a &lt; 2 the",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_6k",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 11319,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "strut crushes even at θ = 45°: enlarge the section.",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_6l",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 11349,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "Tension (NEd &lt; 0): θ from CSA A23.3, θ = 29° + 7000·εx (εx = strain at mid-depth from the",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_6m",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 11379,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "tension chord force), with cotθ kept between 1 and the compression value.",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_6n",
